```
Reason:
The bug occurs because after calling `scmi_do_xfer`, the response size (`num_returned`) is derived from the previous command's response without resetting the receive buffer size (`rx.len`). This can lead to incorrect interpretation of the response size if the next response from the firmware is larger than the size set by the previous response.

